{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：11:04 2026-09-01 HKT<br/>發佈時間：11:04 2026-09-01 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：11:04 2026-09-01 HKT</p><p>今日（9月1日）早上9時46分，火炭樂景街2至18號銀禧花園發生煤氣洩漏事件，第5座有外牆煤氣喉漏氣，引起火警。消防接報到場，關閉煤氣掣進行灌救，其後將火救熄。事件中無人受傷，亦毋須疏散，事故原因有待調查。</p><img alt=\"銀禧花園第5座有外牆煤氣喉漏氣，引起火警。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/de19e135a48c4da7f37ceafa64200780/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-01_at_10_47_32_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/7f479019b194c973d45c9a8b5fe4e21d/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-01_at_10_47_32_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防將火救熄。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/9b1bb30642421062fbea08bf0b937416/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-01_at_10_47_31.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/6c6f3ebe6082624bde34c01f7a343911/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-01_at_10_47_32_3_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ul/sthl/81bb0d013d9b9cbd8c3e6345298ddb6d/2026-09/WhatsApp_Image_2026-09-01_at_10_47_32.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-01T03:21:00.128241+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":186,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}